The transcript of the KVM Forum Contributor Q&A Panel is available here:
https://etherpad.net/p/KVMForum2018Panel

The topics discussed included how to get big features upstream,
email/patch workflow, how to discuss ideas with the community,
Spectre/Meltdown, and the perspective of cloud providers who are
investing in QEMU/KVM.

The panelists included Christian Borntraeger (IBM), Cornelia Huck (Red
Hat), Peter Feiner (Google), Peter Maydell (qemu.git maintainer,
Linaro), and Wanpeng Li (Tencent).

Video will be available soon.

